window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/security-v26-050-b44a5c4103f66d19.json"]={sha256:"b44a5c4103f66d1978f959edccb65476270c644175590a4ffd3e1499a6bc23f0",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v26-case-ab5f25dd0c0ced90","url":"https://github.com/linux-audit/audit-documentation","title":"Linux Audit documentation and specifications","titleEn":"Linux Audit documentation and specifications","publisher":"Linux Audit Project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v26-050","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"security-v26-050","related":[{"id":"security-v26-051","referenceUrls":["https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/218/final"],"title":"NIST SSDF：把安全需求變成發布證據","titleEn":"NIST SSDF: release evidence from security requirements","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：96%與99%按事件而非行數計，剩餘10個缺口保留；沒有以清空稽核檔或停用規則來降低錯誤。 交付1000事件完整度報告、重啟/亂序案例與遺失定位流程。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Compute 96% and 99% by events rather than lines and retain ten gaps; errors are not reduced by clearing logs or disabling rules. Deliver a 1000-event completeness report, reboot/out-of-order cases and loss-localization flow.","difference":"建立需求、負責人、測試、證據雜湊與到期日的追蹤表，區分完成宣稱與可重驗證據。","differenceEn":"Build a requirement-owner-test-evidence-digest-expiry matrix and distinguish claimed completion from reproducible evidence.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["完整事件率=具所有所需紀錄的事件/預期事件；不能拿稽核行數直接當操作數，多筆紀錄不代表多次操作。 合成預期1000事件，960事件紀錄完整，40事件缺必要PATH或SYSCALL；每事件記錄數可不同。 960/1000×100=96%；修復30事件後990/1000×100=99%。","覆蓋率以適用控制為分母；缺證據與不適用必須分欄，通過數不代表整體風險機率。 以下為自編合成案例，只在自己的離線文件、測試資料或明確授權的隔離環境演練；不是產品實測或生產設定。 20 個候選控制，4 個有核准理由而不適用；16 個適用中12個有新鮮證據。 有效覆蓋率=12/(20−4)=75%；若誤用全體分母會算成60%。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Complete-event rate equals events with all required records divided by expected events; log-line count is not operation count because events span records. Expect 1000 synthetic events: 960 complete and 40 missing required PATH or SYSCALL, with variable record counts per event. 960/1000×100=96%; repairing 30 gives 990/1000×100=99%.","Coverage uses applicable controls as its denominator; missing evidence and non-applicability are separate states, not risk probabilities. This original synthetic case uses owned offline files, test data or an explicitly authorized isolated lab; it is not a product benchmark or a production configuration. There are 20 candidate controls, 4 approved non-applicable controls, and fresh evidence for 12 of the 16 applicable controls. Effective coverage=12/(20−4)=75%; using all controls instead produces 60%.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"security-v26-060","referenceUrls":["https://scorecard.dev/"],"title":"OpenSSF Scorecard：風險訊號與發布決策","titleEn":"OpenSSF Scorecard: risk signals and release decisions","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：96%與99%按事件而非行數計，剩餘10個缺口保留；沒有以清空稽核檔或停用規則來降低錯誤。 交付1000事件完整度報告、重啟/亂序案例與遺失定位流程。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Compute 96% and 99% by events rather than lines and retain ten gaps; errors are not reduced by clearing logs or disabling rules. Deliver a 1000-event completeness report, reboot/out-of-order cases and loss-localization flow.","difference":"將各檢查的證據、失敗原因與風險分開，辨識未執行或不適用項，拒絕只看平均分數。","differenceEn":"Separate evidence, failure reason and risk for each check; identify skipped and non-applicable items rather than relying on an average.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["完整事件率=具所有所需紀錄的事件/預期事件；不能拿稽核行數直接當操作數，多筆紀錄不代表多次操作。 合成預期1000事件，960事件紀錄完整，40事件缺必要PATH或SYSCALL；每事件記錄數可不同。 960/1000×100=96%；修復30事件後990/1000×100=99%。","本課自訂加權平均=Σ權重×分數/Σ權重；這不是官方總分演算法，也不是漏洞機率。 以下為自編合成案例，只在自己的離線文件、測試資料或明確授權的隔離環境演練；不是產品實測或生產設定。 四項教學分數8、6、10、2；權重1、2、1、4，最後一項代表重要發布控制。 加權分數=(8+12+10+8)/8=4.75，簡單平均為6.5。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Complete-event rate equals events with all required records divided by expected events; log-line count is not operation count because events span records. Expect 1000 synthetic events: 960 complete and 40 missing required PATH or SYSCALL, with variable record counts per event. 960/1000×100=96%; repairing 30 gives 990/1000×100=99%.","The teaching weighted mean is Σweight×score/Σweight; it is neither the official aggregate algorithm nor a vulnerability probability. This original synthetic case uses owned offline files, test data or an explicitly authorized isolated lab; it is not a product benchmark or a production configuration. Four teaching scores are 8,6,10,2 with weights 1,2,1,4; the last represents a critical release control. Weighted score=(8+12+10+8)/8=4.75, versus a simple mean of 6.5.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v26-case-3382974f730f995a","url":"https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/218/final","title":"NIST SP 800-218: SSDF Version 1.1","titleEn":"NIST SP 800-218: SSDF Version 1.1","publisher":"NIST","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v26-case-253812f1e5c26886","url":"https://scorecard.dev/","title":"OpenSSF Scorecard","titleEn":"OpenSSF Scorecard","publisher":"OpenSSF","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
